<mxfile host="65bd71144e">
    <diagram id="boot" name="01 · Загрузка до userspace">
        <mxGraphModel dx="2289" dy="1160" grid="1" gridSize="10" guides="1" tooltips="1" connect="1" arrows="1" fold="1" page="1" pageScale="1" pageWidth="1560" pageHeight="1320" math="0" shadow="0">
            <root>
                <mxCell id="0"/>
                <mxCell id="1" parent="0"/>
                <mxCell id="title" parent="1" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;fontColor=#20354c;fontSize=30;fontStyle=1;" value="PureC OS · От загрузчика до userspace" vertex="1">
                    <mxGeometry height="45" width="1460" x="50" y="25" as="geometry"/>
                </mxCell>
                <mxCell id="sub" parent="1" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;fontColor=#20354c;fontSize=15;fontStyle=1;" value="Текущая реализация • x86-64 / Limine • 19.09.2026 • Читай левую колонку сверху вниз, затем правую." vertex="1">
                    <mxGeometry height="40" width="1450" x="50" y="78" as="geometry"/>
                </mxCell>
                <mxCell id="left" parent="1" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;fontColor=#20354c;fontSize=20;fontStyle=1;" value="A · Прошивка и ранний старт" vertex="1">
                    <mxGeometry height="35" width="610" x="60" y="128" as="geometry"/>
                </mxCell>
                <mxCell id="right" parent="1" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;fontColor=#20354c;fontSize=20;fontStyle=1;" value="B · Подсистемы и запуск среды" vertex="1">
                    <mxGeometry height="35" width="610" x="870" y="128" as="geometry"/>
                </mxCell>
                <mxCell id="b1" parent="1" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#fff3df;strokeColor=#bb761c;fontColor=#172638;fontSize=15;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacing=15;arcSize=10;" value="&lt;b&gt;01  BIOS / UEFI → Limine&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;Чтение limine.conf; выбор primary или fallback.&lt;br&gt;ISO либо EFI System Partition (ESP).&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size:11px&quot; color=&quot;#536174&quot;&gt;src/boot/limine.conf.in • src/fs/fat/fat32.c&lt;/font&gt;" vertex="1">
                    <mxGeometry height="125" width="630" x="60" y="180" as="geometry"/>
                </mxCell>
                <mxCell id="b2" parent="1" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#fff3df;strokeColor=#bb761c;fontColor=#172638;fontSize=15;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacing=15;arcSize=10;" value="&lt;b&gt;02  Limine загружает ядро и модули&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;kernel.elf + initramfs + ресурсы установщика.&lt;br&gt;Передаёт framebuffer, memmap, HHDM, RSDP и SMP.&lt;br&gt;Вход уже в 64-bit long mode, paging включён.&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size:11px&quot; color=&quot;#536174&quot;&gt;src/boot/boot.c: Limine requests&lt;/font&gt;" vertex="1">
                    <mxGeometry height="125" width="630" x="60" y="335" as="geometry"/>
                </mxCell>
                <mxCell id="b3" parent="1" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#e9f1fc;strokeColor=#4875aa;fontColor=#172638;fontSize=15;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacing=15;arcSize=10;" value="&lt;b&gt;03  _start(): принятие boot responses&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;Serial → проверка протокола и framebuffer.&lt;br&gt;Сохранение ответов Limine; настройка адресов MMIO.&lt;br&gt;GOP/framebuffer → klog → boot_diag.&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size:11px&quot; color=&quot;#536174&quot;&gt;src/boot/boot.c&lt;/font&gt;" vertex="1">
                    <mxGeometry height="125" width="630" x="60" y="490" as="geometry"/>
                </mxCell>
                <mxCell id="b4" parent="1" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#e9f1fc;strokeColor=#4875aa;fontColor=#172638;fontSize=15;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacing=15;arcSize=10;" value="&lt;b&gt;04  Базовая инфраструктура x86-64&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;PIC → GDT/TSS/IST → IDT, включая int 0x80.&lt;br&gt;PS/2 mouse → timer_init(1000) → STI.&lt;br&gt;Затем вызов kernel_main().&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size:11px&quot; color=&quot;#536174&quot;&gt;src/boot/boot.c • src/arch/x86_64/{gdt,idt}&lt;/font&gt;" vertex="1">
                    <mxGeometry height="125" width="630" x="60" y="645" as="geometry"/>
                </mxCell>
                <mxCell id="b5" parent="1" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#f0eafa;strokeColor=#8462a7;fontColor=#172638;fontSize=15;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacing=15;arcSize=10;" value="&lt;b&gt;05  CPU, память и начальная ФС&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;cpu_topology_init → system_info_init.&lt;br&gt;PMM → VMM → vfs_mount_initramfs().&lt;br&gt;CPIO проверяется; строится индекс файлов в RAM.&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size:11px&quot; color=&quot;#536174&quot;&gt;src/kernel/core/kernel.c • src/mm • src/fs/initramfs.c&lt;/font&gt;" vertex="1">
                    <mxGeometry height="125" width="630" x="60" y="800" as="geometry"/>
                </mxCell>
                <mxCell id="b6" parent="1" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#e9f1fc;strokeColor=#4875aa;fontColor=#172638;fontSize=15;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacing=15;arcSize=10;" value="&lt;b&gt;06  Состояние ядра&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;FPU → power_init / ACPI → process_init.&lt;br&gt;Проверка IDT через int3.&lt;br&gt;MMIO mapper → smp_start_all().&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size:11px&quot; color=&quot;#536174&quot;&gt;src/kernel/core/kernel.c&lt;/font&gt;" vertex="1">
                    <mxGeometry height="125" width="630" x="60" y="955" as="geometry"/>
                </mxCell>
                <mxCell id="b7" parent="1" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#e9f1fc;strokeColor=#4875aa;fontColor=#172638;fontSize=15;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacing=15;arcSize=10;" value="&lt;b&gt;07  syscall_init() и дисковые устройства&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;Audio → PCI storage probe → block_device_init.&lt;br&gt;Попытка монтирования диска: ext2, затем FAT32.&lt;br&gt;Если диск не смонтирован, начальный root — initramfs.&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size:11px&quot; color=&quot;#536174&quot;&gt;src/kernel/syscall/syscall.c • src/fs/vfs.c&lt;/font&gt;" vertex="1">
                    <mxGeometry height="125" width="630" x="870" y="180" as="geometry"/>
                </mxCell>
                <mxCell id="b8" parent="1" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#e9f1fc;strokeColor=#4875aa;fontColor=#172638;fontSize=15;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacing=15;arcSize=10;" value="&lt;b&gt;08  Сеть и обнаружение устройств&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;net_service_init → проверка syscall WRITE.&lt;br&gt;devman_init → PCI / ACPI enumeration.&lt;br&gt;Затем init_process_start().&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size:11px&quot; color=&quot;#536174&quot;&gt;src/kernel/core/kernel.c • src/kernel/devices&lt;/font&gt;" vertex="1">
                    <mxGeometry height="125" width="630" x="870" y="335" as="geometry"/>
                </mxCell>
                <mxCell id="b9" parent="1" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#e9f1fc;strokeColor=#4875aa;fontColor=#172638;fontSize=15;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacing=15;arcSize=10;" value="&lt;b&gt;09  Создание PID 1&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;scheduler_init → process_spawn_module(&quot;/bin/init&quot;).&lt;br&gt;ELF → адресное пространство → пользовательский поток.&lt;br&gt;PID 1 создан; выполнение начнётся по планировщику.&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size:11px&quot; color=&quot;#536174&quot;&gt;src/kernel/core/init.c • src/kernel/process/process.c&lt;/font&gt;" vertex="1">
                    <mxGeometry height="125" width="630" x="870" y="490" as="geometry"/>
                </mxCell>
                <mxCell id="b10" parent="1" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#e9f1fc;strokeColor=#4875aa;fontColor=#172638;fontSize=15;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacing=15;arcSize=10;" value="&lt;b&gt;10  Подготовка рабочего стола · Ring 0&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;userspace_init(): keyboard, desktop entries, display.&lt;br&gt;Рисование рабочего стола, панели и оконная среда.&lt;br&gt;Создание процесса /bin/program/login.&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size:11px&quot; color=&quot;#536174&quot;&gt;src/userspace/userspace.c — код слинкован с ядром&lt;/font&gt;" vertex="1">
                    <mxGeometry height="125" width="630" x="870" y="645" as="geometry"/>
                </mxCell>
                <mxCell id="b11" parent="1" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#e9f1fc;strokeColor=#4875aa;fontColor=#172638;fontSize=15;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacing=15;arcSize=10;" value="&lt;b&gt;11  Запуск планировщика&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;Создание потоков input, keyboard, kernel-log, net-rx.&lt;br&gt;Условные self-tests → scheduler_start().&lt;br&gt;AP выходят из ожидания; выбор готовых потоков.&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size:11px&quot; color=&quot;#536174&quot;&gt;src/kernel/core/init.c • src/kernel/process/scheduler.c&lt;/font&gt;" vertex="1">
                    <mxGeometry height="125" width="630" x="870" y="800" as="geometry"/>
                </mxCell>
                <mxCell id="b12" parent="1" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#e4f4ee;strokeColor=#38836c;fontColor=#172638;fontSize=15;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacing=15;arcSize=10;" value="&lt;b&gt;12  Работа системы&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;Потоки ядра: рабочий стол, ввод, сеть, журнал.&lt;br&gt;Ring 3: /bin/init, login, terminal и другие ELF.&lt;br&gt;Переходы: iretq в Ring 3, int 0x80 в ядро.&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size:11px&quot; color=&quot;#536174&quot;&gt;src/arch/x86_64/user.asm • src/programs&lt;/font&gt;" vertex="1">
                    <mxGeometry height="125" width="630" x="870" y="955" as="geometry"/>
                </mxCell>
                <mxCell id="legend" parent="1" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#fff8d9;strokeColor=#bf9b3b;fontColor=#172638;fontSize=15;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacing=15;arcSize=10;" value="&lt;b&gt;Как читать схему&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;Оранжевый — загрузчик; синий — Ring 0; фиолетовый — память; зелёный — Ring 3.&lt;br&gt;Стрелки на этой странице показывают порядок инициализации. Подробности — на страницах 02–04." vertex="1">
                    <mxGeometry height="90" width="1440" x="60" y="1135" as="geometry"/>
                </mxCell>
                <mxCell id="edge1" edge="1" parent="1" source="b1" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;html=1;endArrow=block;endFill=1;strokeColor=#64778b;strokeWidth=2;fontSize=12;fontColor=#33475b;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;" target="b2" value="">
                    <mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"/>
                </mxCell>
                <mxCell id="edge2" edge="1" parent="1" source="b2" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;html=1;endArrow=block;endFill=1;strokeColor=#64778b;strokeWidth=2;fontSize=12;fontColor=#33475b;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;" target="b3" value="">
                    <mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"/>
                </mxCell>
                <mxCell id="edge3" edge="1" parent="1" source="b3" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;html=1;endArrow=block;endFill=1;strokeColor=#64778b;strokeWidth=2;fontSize=12;fontColor=#33475b;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;" target="b4" value="">
                    <mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"/>
                </mxCell>
                <mxCell id="edge4" edge="1" parent="1" source="b4" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;html=1;endArrow=block;endFill=1;strokeColor=#64778b;strokeWidth=2;fontSize=12;fontColor=#33475b;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;" target="b5" value="">
                    <mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"/>
                </mxCell>
                <mxCell id="edge5" edge="1" parent="1" source="b5" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;html=1;endArrow=block;endFill=1;strokeColor=#64778b;strokeWidth=2;fontSize=12;fontColor=#33475b;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;" target="b6" value="">
                    <mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"/>
                </mxCell>
                <mxCell id="edge6" edge="1" parent="1" source="b6" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;html=1;endArrow=block;endFill=1;strokeColor=#64778b;strokeWidth=2;fontSize=12;fontColor=#33475b;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;exitX=1;exitY=0.5;entryX=0;entryY=0.5;" target="b7" value="дальше">
                    <mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry">
                        <Array as="points">
                            <mxPoint x="770" y="1017"/>
                            <mxPoint x="770" y="242"/>
                        </Array>
                    </mxGeometry>
                </mxCell>
                <mxCell id="edge7" edge="1" parent="1" source="b7" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;html=1;endArrow=block;endFill=1;strokeColor=#64778b;strokeWidth=2;fontSize=12;fontColor=#33475b;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;" target="b8" value="">
                    <mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"/>
                </mxCell>
                <mxCell id="edge8" edge="1" parent="1" source="b8" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;html=1;endArrow=block;endFill=1;strokeColor=#64778b;strokeWidth=2;fontSize=12;fontColor=#33475b;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;" target="b9" value="">
                    <mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"/>
                </mxCell>
                <mxCell id="edge9" edge="1" parent="1" source="b9" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;html=1;endArrow=block;endFill=1;strokeColor=#64778b;strokeWidth=2;fontSize=12;fontColor=#33475b;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;" target="b10" value="">
                    <mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"/>
                </mxCell>
                <mxCell id="edge10" edge="1" parent="1" source="b10" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;html=1;endArrow=block;endFill=1;strokeColor=#64778b;strokeWidth=2;fontSize=12;fontColor=#33475b;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;" target="b11" value="">
                    <mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"/>
                </mxCell>
                <mxCell id="edge11" edge="1" parent="1" source="b11" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;html=1;endArrow=block;endFill=1;strokeColor=#64778b;strokeWidth=2;fontSize=12;fontColor=#33475b;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;" target="b12" value="">
                    <mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"/>
                </mxCell>
            </root>
        </mxGraphModel>
    </diagram>
    <diagram id="process" name="02 · ELF, Ring 3 и системные вызовы">
        <mxGraphModel dx="1900" dy="1353" grid="1" gridSize="10" guides="1" tooltips="1" connect="1" arrows="1" fold="1" page="1" pageScale="1" pageWidth="1560" pageHeight="1430" math="0" shadow="0">
            <root>
                <mxCell id="0"/>
                <mxCell id="1" parent="0"/>
                <mxCell id="title" parent="1" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;fontColor=#20354c;fontSize=29;fontStyle=1;" value="Создание процесса и граница Ring 0 ↔ Ring 3" vertex="1">
                    <mxGeometry height="50" width="1480" x="50" y="25" as="geometry"/>
                </mxCell>
                <mxCell id="sub" parent="1" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;fontColor=#20354c;fontSize=15;fontStyle=1;" value="PID 1 и пользовательские приложения используют один загрузчик ELF. Исходники: src/kernel/process, src/arch/x86_64, src/programs/init." vertex="1">
                    <mxGeometry height="45" width="1460" x="50" y="80" as="geometry"/>
                </mxCell>
                <mxCell id="request" parent="1" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#e9f1fc;strokeColor=#4875aa;fontColor=#172638;fontSize=15;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacing=15;arcSize=10;" value="&lt;b&gt;Запрос запуска&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;Boot: /bin/init; desktop: login / выбранная программа.&lt;br&gt;Из Ring 3: SYS_EXEC → process_spawn_module()." vertex="1">
                    <mxGeometry height="100" width="670" x="60" y="160" as="geometry"/>
                </mxCell>
                <mxCell id="lookup" parent="1" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#e9f1fc;strokeColor=#4875aa;fontColor=#172638;fontSize=15;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacing=15;arcSize=10;" value="&lt;b&gt;Поиск образа: process_spawn_module()&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;1. initramfs_find(path), затем program_alias_resolve().&lt;br&gt;2. Если отсутствует: VFS open / stat / read.&lt;br&gt;Initramfs: прямой указатель; VFS: временная копия ELF." vertex="1">
                    <mxGeometry height="130" width="670" x="60" y="310" as="geometry"/>
                </mxCell>
                <mxCell id="elf" parent="1" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#f0eafa;strokeColor=#8462a7;fontColor=#172638;fontSize=15;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacing=15;arcSize=10;" value="&lt;b&gt;process_spawn_elf() / elf_load_user_image()&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;PMM: дескриптор процесса; VMM: новое адресное пространство.&lt;br&gt;Проверка ELF64 x86-64 / PT_LOAD; страницы и копирование.&lt;br&gt;Права USER / WRITABLE / NX; общая верхняя половина ядра.&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size:11px&quot; color=&quot;#536174&quot;&gt;src/kernel/process/elf.c • src/mm/vmm.c&lt;/font&gt;" vertex="1">
                    <mxGeometry height="135" width="670" x="60" y="485" as="geometry"/>
                </mxCell>
                <mxCell id="ready" parent="1" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#e9f1fc;strokeColor=#4875aa;fontColor=#172638;fontSize=15;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacing=15;arcSize=10;" value="&lt;b&gt;Готовый процесс и поток&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;User stack + heap bounds + args/env + PID.&lt;br&gt;scheduler_create_user_thread(): kernel stack и начальный контекст.&lt;br&gt;Процесс READY ждёт выбора планировщиком.&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size:11px&quot; color=&quot;#536174&quot;&gt;src/kernel/process/process.c&lt;/font&gt;" vertex="1">
                    <mxGeometry height="120" width="670" x="60" y="665" as="geometry"/>
                </mxCell>
                <mxCell id="switch" parent="1" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#e9f1fc;strokeColor=#4875aa;fontColor=#172638;fontSize=15;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacing=15;arcSize=10;" value="&lt;b&gt;Планировщик выбирает поток&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;Сохранение FPU; TSS kernel stack; переключение CR3.&lt;br&gt;scheduler_asm_switch → thread_trampoline → user_process_entry.&lt;br&gt;process state = RUNNING; arch_enter_user(entry, stack).&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size:11px&quot; color=&quot;#536174&quot;&gt;src/kernel/process/scheduler.c • src/arch/x86_64/scheduler.asm&lt;/font&gt;" vertex="1">
                    <mxGeometry height="125" width="670" x="60" y="830" as="geometry"/>
                </mxCell>
                <mxCell id="iret" parent="1" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#e4f4ee;strokeColor=#38836c;fontColor=#172638;fontSize=15;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacing=15;arcSize=10;" value="&lt;b&gt;Вход в Ring 3&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;arch_enter_user(): user SS/CS, RSP/RIP, IF=1 → iretq.&lt;br&gt;CPU продолжает с entry point ELF.&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size:11px&quot; color=&quot;#536174&quot;&gt;src/arch/x86_64/user.asm&lt;/font&gt;" vertex="1">
                    <mxGeometry height="100" width="670" x="60" y="1000" as="geometry"/>
                </mxCell>
                <mxCell id="apps" parent="1" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#e4f4ee;strokeColor=#38836c;fontColor=#172638;fontSize=15;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacing=15;arcSize=10;" value="&lt;b&gt;Ring 3 · исполнение приложений&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;/bin/init: собирает завершившихся детей и pc_sleep(500).&lt;br&gt;login, terminal, installer, monitor и другие ELF.&lt;br&gt;Вызовы ядра через библиотеки libc / libgui / libfs / libaudio.&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size:11px&quot; color=&quot;#536174&quot;&gt;src/programs/init/main.c • src/libc • src/libgui • src/libfs&lt;/font&gt;" vertex="1">
                    <mxGeometry height="135" width="630" x="870" y="160" as="geometry"/>
                </mxCell>
                <mxCell id="int" parent="1" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#e9f1fc;strokeColor=#4875aa;fontColor=#172638;fontSize=15;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacing=15;arcSize=10;" value="&lt;b&gt;int 0x80 → Ring 0&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;IDT gate DPL3; переход на kernel stack через TSS.&lt;br&gt;ISR сохраняет регистры; idt.c → syscall_handler().&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size:11px&quot; color=&quot;#536174&quot;&gt;src/arch/x86_64/idt • src/kernel/syscall/syscall.c&lt;/font&gt;" vertex="1">
                    <mxGeometry height="110" width="630" x="870" y="360" as="geometry"/>
                </mxCell>
                <mxCell id="dispatch" parent="1" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#e9f1fc;strokeColor=#4875aa;fontColor=#172638;fontSize=15;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacing=15;arcSize=10;" value="&lt;b&gt;Обработка системного вызова&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;Проверка пользовательских адресов и прав.&lt;br&gt;Диспетчер: процессы, VFS, GUI, устройства, сеть.&lt;br&gt;Результат возвращается в RAX; возврат через ISR / iretq." vertex="1">
                    <mxGeometry height="120" width="630" x="870" y="535" as="geometry"/>
                </mxCell>
                <mxCell id="services" parent="1" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#e9f1fc;strokeColor=#4875aa;fontColor=#172638;fontSize=15;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacing=15;arcSize=10;" value="&lt;b&gt;Операции ядра&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;SYS_EXEC → ещё один процесс.&lt;br&gt;SYS_WAIT / SYS_EXIT → ожидание и освобождение ресурсов.&lt;br&gt;Файлы: таблица fd процесса → VFS → backend." vertex="1">
                    <mxGeometry height="115" width="630" x="870" y="720" as="geometry"/>
                </mxCell>
                <mxCell id="note" parent="1" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#fff8d9;strokeColor=#bf9b3b;fontColor=#172638;fontSize=15;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacing=15;arcSize=10;" value="&lt;b&gt;Границы исполнения&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;Название src/userspace не означает Ring 3: desktop и window_manager работают внутри ядра.&lt;br&gt;PID 1 сейчас выполняет цикл reaping; графическую среду создаёт init_process_start() в Ring 0.&lt;br&gt;Ошибки загрузки init приводят к kernel_panic с причиной из process_last_spawn_error()." vertex="1">
                    <mxGeometry height="145" width="1440" x="60" y="1170" as="geometry"/>
                </mxCell>
                <mxCell id="edge1" edge="1" parent="1" source="request" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;html=1;endArrow=block;endFill=1;strokeColor=#64778b;strokeWidth=2;fontSize=12;fontColor=#33475b;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;" target="lookup" value="">
                    <mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"/>
                </mxCell>
                <mxCell id="edge2" edge="1" parent="1" source="lookup" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;html=1;endArrow=block;endFill=1;strokeColor=#64778b;strokeWidth=2;fontSize=12;fontColor=#33475b;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;" target="elf" value="">
                    <mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"/>
                </mxCell>
                <mxCell id="edge3" edge="1" parent="1" source="elf" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;html=1;endArrow=block;endFill=1;strokeColor=#64778b;strokeWidth=2;fontSize=12;fontColor=#33475b;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;" target="ready" value="">
                    <mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"/>
                </mxCell>
                <mxCell id="edge4" edge="1" parent="1" source="ready" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;html=1;endArrow=block;endFill=1;strokeColor=#64778b;strokeWidth=2;fontSize=12;fontColor=#33475b;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;" target="switch" value="">
                    <mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"/>
                </mxCell>
                <mxCell id="edge5" edge="1" parent="1" source="switch" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;html=1;endArrow=block;endFill=1;strokeColor=#64778b;strokeWidth=2;fontSize=12;fontColor=#33475b;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;" target="iret" value="">
                    <mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"/>
                </mxCell>
                <mxCell id="edge6" edge="1" parent="1" source="iret" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;html=1;endArrow=block;endFill=1;strokeColor=#64778b;strokeWidth=2;fontSize=12;fontColor=#33475b;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;exitX=1;exitY=0.5;entryX=0;entryY=0.5;" target="apps" value="entry ELF">
                    <mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry">
                        <Array as="points">
                            <mxPoint x="800" y="1050"/>
                            <mxPoint x="800" y="228"/>
                        </Array>
                    </mxGeometry>
                </mxCell>
                <mxCell id="edge7" edge="1" parent="1" source="apps" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;html=1;endArrow=block;endFill=1;strokeColor=#64778b;strokeWidth=2;fontSize=12;fontColor=#33475b;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;" target="int" value="вызов">
                    <mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"/>
                </mxCell>
                <mxCell id="edge8" edge="1" parent="1" source="int" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;html=1;endArrow=block;endFill=1;strokeColor=#64778b;strokeWidth=2;fontSize=12;fontColor=#33475b;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;" target="dispatch" value="">
                    <mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"/>
                </mxCell>
                <mxCell id="edge9" edge="1" parent="1" source="dispatch" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;html=1;endArrow=block;endFill=1;strokeColor=#64778b;strokeWidth=2;fontSize=12;fontColor=#33475b;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;" target="services" value="обработчик">
                    <mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"/>
                </mxCell>
                <mxCell id="edge10" edge="1" parent="1" source="dispatch" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;html=1;endArrow=block;endFill=1;strokeColor=#64778b;strokeWidth=2;fontSize=12;fontColor=#33475b;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;dashed=1;exitX=1;exitY=0.5;entryX=1;entryY=0.5;" target="apps" value="результат">
                    <mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry">
